              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Joshuwa wakusanya atu osi a mbari ya Rubini, ya Gadi na nusu ya mbari ya Manase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.20+NUM.32.21+NUM.32.22+NUM.32.23+NUM.32.24+NUM.32.25+NUM.32.26+NUM.32.27+NUM.32.28+NUM.32.29+NUM.32.30+NUM.32.31+NUM.32.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 32:20–32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 1:12–15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye achiambira, “Mkahenda gosi ambago Musa mtumishi wa Mwenyezi Mlungu walagiza, na mkanisikira kpwa gosi gokuamuruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwi tamuarichire ndugu zenu muda wosi uhu hadi rero ela mwalunga kpwa makini malagizo ga Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivi, kpwa vira Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu akaapha ndugu zenu amani kama arivyoahidi, sambi uyani kpwenu, tsi ambayo Musa mtumishi wa Mwenyezi Mlungu wakuphani ngʼambo ya muho Joridani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kalani matso kpwa kulunga malagizo na shariya ambazo Musa mtumishi wa Mwenyezi Mlungu wakuphani. Mendzani Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, hendani amendzavyo, lungani malagizoge, kuluphirani hiye na mumuhumikire moyo kutsuka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Joshuwa waabariki, achiambira auye kpwao mahemani, nao achiuya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nusu ya mbari ya Manase, Musa kala akaapha seemu ya Bashani ela nusu hira yanjina ya mbari iyo, Joshuwa waapha tsi iriyo mtswerero wa dzuwa wa muho Joridani phamwenga na ndugu zao. Joshuwa ariphoambira auye kaya, waabariki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "achiambira, “Uyani kpwenu phamwenga na utajiri wenu munji — mifugo minji sana, feza, zahabu, shaba, chuma na mavwazi manji sana. Aganyireni ndugu zenu vyo vitu murivyohala zewe kula kpwa maadui genu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo mbari ya Rubini, ya Gadi na nusu ya mbari ya Manase auya kpwao, achirichana na Aiziraeli hiko Shilo, iriyo tsi ya Kanani achiphiya tsi ya Giliadi, tsi yao ambayo aihala ikale yao kpwa malagizo ga Mwenyezi Mlungu kutsupira Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphofika Gelilothi iriyo tsi ya Kanani phephi na muho Joridani, atu a mbari ya Rubini, ya Gadi na nusu ya mbari ya Manase adzenga phatu phakulu pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aiziraeli asikira kukala atu a mbari ya Rubini, ya Gadi na nusu ya mbari ya Manase akadzenga phatu pha kulavira sadaka katika seemu ya mphaka wa Kanani hiko Gelilothi phephi na muho Joridani uphande wa Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphosikira hivyo kundi rosi ra Aiziraeli rakutana hiko Shilo ili rikapigane nao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Aiziraeli ahuma atu aphiye hadi Giliadi kpwa mbari ya Rubini, ya Gadi na nusu ya mbari ya Manase. Atu ariohumwa ni hano: Finehasi mwana wa mlavyadzi-sadaka Eliazari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "phamwenga na vilongozi kumi a mbari, chila mbari ya Iziraeli chilongozi mmwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphofika Giliadi kpwa mbari ya Rubini, ya Gadi na nusu ya mbari ya Manase, akpwendaamba: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.13+DEU.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 12:13–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kundi rosi ra Mwenyezi Mlungu rinaamba ‘Mbona mkamkosera Mlungu wa Iziraeli? Mana mkamuasi Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa kudzenga phatu pha kulavira sadaka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 25:1–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dambi hurirohenda Peori rahurehera shaka ambaro richereyuga kundi ra Mwenyezi Mlungu na tahudzangbwedzitakasa hadi rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona mkaricha kulunga ga Mlungu? Ichikala rero mundamuasi Mwenyezi Mlungu, muhondo andatsukirira kundi rosi ra Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichikala tsi mriyonayo ni najisi, ndzoni tsi ya Mwenyezi Mlungu phatu pharipho na hema ra Mwenyezi Mlungu mphahe seemu za kusagala kahi zehu. Ela msimuasi Mwenyezi Mlungu wala msihutiye makosani",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tafusiri zanjina zinaamba,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ela msigomere Mwenyezi Mlungu wala swiswi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kpwa kudzidzengera phatu phanjina pha kulavira sadaka, badala ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.1+JOS.7.2+JOS.7.3+JOS.7.4+JOS.7.5+JOS.7.6+JOS.7.7+JOS.7.8+JOS.7.9+JOS.7.10+JOS.7.11+JOS.7.12+JOS.7.13+JOS.7.14+JOS.7.15+JOS.7.16+JOS.7.17+JOS.7.18+JOS.7.19+JOS.7.20+JOS.7.21+JOS.7.22+JOS.7.23+JOS.7.24+JOS.7.25+JOS.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 7:1–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akani mwana wa Zera ariphokosa uaminifu kpwa kuhala vitu vyotengbwa, Mlungu watsukirira kundi rosi ra Aiziraeli. Naye kayafwa macheye kpwa ajili ya dambi hiyo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho atu a mbari ya Rubini, ya Gadi na nusu ya mbari ya Manase aajibu vilongozi a miryango ya Iziraeli achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mlungu mwenye uwezo wosi, Mlungu, Mwenyezi Mlungu! Mlungu mwenye uwezo wosi, Mlungu, Mwenyezi Mlungu! Iye Anamanya na Aiziraeli nao andamanya kpwa utu wani hukahenda hivi. Ichikala ni kuasi ama kukosa kumkuluphira Mwenyezi Mlungu, phahi huolageni ihi rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho hwadzenga phatu hipha pha kulavira sadaka ili hukariche kumlunga Mwenyezi Mlungu, au kpwa ajili ya kulavya sadaka za kuochwa, sadaka za mtsere ama sadaka za amani, phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu mwenye naahuone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela swiswi hwahenda hivi kpwa makini na kpwa lengo malumu. Hwaogopha sedze ana enu akedzaambira ana ehu, ‘Mwimwi tamuna uhusiano wowosi na Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tamuona kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu akahenda muho Joridani ukale mphaka kahi yehu na mwimwi atu a mbari ya Rubini na ya Gadi? Mwimwi tamuna mtalo kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu.’ Chihivyo ana enu anaweza kuahenda ana enu kusika kuvoya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo huchiamba, ‘Nahudzengeni phatu pha kulavira sadaka ela sipho pha kulavira sadaka za kuochwa wala kulavira sadaka yoyosi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela ikale ushaidi kahi yehu na mwimwi, na kahi ya vivyazi bada yehu ya kpwamba swiswi piya hunamuhumikira Mwenyezi Mlungu mbereze kpwa kumlavira sadaka za kuochwa, sadaka za amani na sadaka zanjina ili ana enu asedze akaambira ana ehu kpwamba taana mtalo wowosi kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naswi hwafikiriya kukala siku vivyazi vyenu achedzahuambira dzambo dza hiro au achedzaambira vivyazi vyehu, hundaambira, ‘Lolani mfwano wa phatu pha kulavira sadaka Mwenyezi Mlungu ambapho akare ehu aphadzenga, si kpwa kulavira sadaka za kuochwa ama sadaka zanjina, ela ikale ushaidi kahi yehu na mwimwi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu naasihujaliye nia ya kumuasi rero kpwa kudzenga phatu pha kulavira sadaka za kuochwa, sadaka za mtsere na sadaka zanjina, badala ya pho phatu pha kulavira sadaka pha Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu pharipho mbere za hemare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
